{
  "data": {
    "id": 1094879,
    "name": "\"Sanitize Naturally\" Hand Sanitizer Spray w/ Lemongrass, Orange & Peppermint Essential Oils",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Preferable to the drying and harsh chemicals of typical hand sanitizers our “Sanitize Naturally” antiseptic spray leaves your hands moisturized and smelling wonderful!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients -</span><br></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Aloe vera gel - Its naturally moisturizing, and subsequently healing, properties commonly heal sore &amp; cracked skin.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p><br></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Witch Hazel - Its unique properties offer medicinal anti-inflammatory and anti-viral qualities that are often used in skin care.&nbsp; Witch Hazel also reduces swelling and fights bacteria.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p><br></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">91% Ethanol Alcohol - is a&nbsp;natural bactericidal killing bacteria, fungus, and viruses!</span></li></ul></li></ul><p><br></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lemongrass, orange &amp; peppermint essential oils - are common &amp; leading natural disinfectants!</span></li></ul></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Made in our home in Oregon - you can’t get any better than that!</span></p>",
